# Aurasense on Cloudflare Pages · Build 156 · 22 October 2026
# The same rule as vercel.json: no copy is ever kept between the site and the person, so everyone gets the
# build the stamp says (Lessons, rule 2). And four quiet protections that change nothing anyone sees:
# files are only ever read as what they are; other sites are told only "aurasense.app", never the page;
# no other site can frame these pages; and the site is always reached over a secure connection.
# Build 190 (21 November 2026): the browser is told which features these pages may ever ask for
# (the camera and "where are you" only, and only by aurasense.app itself; never the microphone, payments or
# devices), and framing is closed a second way, so other sites cannot wrap Aurasense in theirs.
# (The Mirror's helper, /api/mirror, sets its own rules: Cloudflare does not apply this file to it.)
/*
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age=0
  CDN-Cache-Control: no-store
  Cloudflare-CDN-Cache-Control: no-store
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), geolocation=(self), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
